#: ../../solver-patchers.md:137
msgid ""
"Runs **outside** the canonical chain: B2 applies it to the RMCarefulXLSX "
"file and copies the capped output back onto that same file, so the "
"`ActUpLim` suffix never appears in the datafile the solver reads. When "
"active it is limited to `activity_upper_limit_scenarios` (shipped "
