msgid ""
"Reads rows from the **Secondary Techs** sheet of "
"`A-O_Parametrization.xlsx` whose `Parameter` equals "
"`activity_upper_limit_parameter_label`. Each year cell holds a "
"**fraction** in `[0, 1]` of that country's electricity demand. The "
"patcher maps each tech to its demand fuel via `OutputActivityRatio`, "
"converts `fraction × demand / OAR` into an absolute cap, and rewrites the"
" `TotalTechnologyAnnualActivityUpperLimit` block."
